  "description": "Professional HTTP-based SDK for TAF Metadata Service. v9.0.4: CRITICAL FIX - Fixed 3 more methods (GetCustomScriptsByAppObjectIdAsync, GetCustomScriptByIdAsync, GetScreenByIdAsync) with same OperationResult unwrapping bug. All methods now correctly call ProcessResponseAsync with unwrapped types. v9.0.3: Fixed GetAppObjectAsync unwrapping bug. v9.0.0: BREAKING CHANGES - All methods now require BusContext instead of Context parameter (MassTransit v2.0.0 compatibility). Upgraded to TAF.Infra.MassTransit v2.0.0 and TAF.Infra.Contract v1.9.0 with centralized OperationResult pattern. v8.0.0: Removed includeQueries parameter, added dedicated Query endpoints. Features Clean Architecture, SOLID principles, explicit BusContext parameter support, comprehensive error handling, screen management, batch relations support, and GUID-based lookups.",
